<div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-16 text-center sm:py-24">
  <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">Everything is included</h1>
  <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
    This is a self-hosted <%= Instance.name %> instance, so there is nothing to buy: every feature, including the full history, tagging, coffee management and Journal, is available to every account.
